  "notes": "RATH DataSource screen. Signature element: the table header is a data profile — each column header has field name, a lightbulb 'Explore In Dataset' button, a light-blue 'transforms' pill with a green numeric badge, a Vega mini-histogram (bars for nominal, area for temporal) and a Unique/Count stats mini-table; hovering reveals semantic type and analytic type dropdowns plus a 'use field' checkbox (column enable/disable). A colored top rule over each header (blue for enabled, grey for disabled field like order_id). Rows with dirty values are tinted pink (#ffcbc7) with dark red text. Black primary split button 'Start Analysis' with mode menu. Meta tab switches to per-field cards with radio groups and toggles. Logo RATH letters multi-colored. Content scrolls inside panels."
